{"id":318,"name":"carvanha","speciesId":318,"dex":318,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["water","dark"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":90,"defense":20,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":20,"speed":65},"abilities":[{"name":"rough-skin","hidden":false},{"name":"speed-boost","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":208,"baseExp":61,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/318.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/318.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/318.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/318.ogg","genus":"Savage Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"CARVANHA’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this POKéMON."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"If anything invades CARVANHA’s territory, it will swarm and tear at the intruder with its pointed fangs. On its own, however, this POKéMON turns suddenly timid."},{"version":"emerald","text":"CARVANHA attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious POKéMON, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone."},{"version":"firered","text":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."},{"version":"diamond","text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Carvanha’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this Pokémon."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If 